CreateSafeRound_Rounds_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the token has no code or its decimals call reverts
│   └── it should reject the token
├── when the caller is not the Safe
│   └── it should revert with OnlyBoard
├── when the cap is 0 or the discount is 10000 or more or the close date is past
│   └── it should revert with InvalidRound
└── when the terms are valid
    ├── it should record the SAFE round
    └── it should emit SafeRoundCreated
